START
Open CryptoHash Analyzer
Show Home Page
User chooses Login, Register, or Demo User

IF Register THEN
    Read username, email, password, confirm password
    Validate username length and allowed characters
    Validate email format
    Validate password length
    Check password confirmation
    Check username is unique
    Hash password with salt
    Save user information in data/users.json
ENDIF

IF Login THEN
    Read username and password
    Load user information file
    Hash entered password with saved salt
    Compare with stored password hash
    IF correct THEN open Main Menu
    ELSE show error
ENDIF

Main Menu Options:
1. Hash With Encryption
2. Hash Without Encryption
3. Message Authentication Code HMAC
4. Verify Hash / Message Integrity
5. File Hashing
6. Logout

Hash Without Encryption:
    Read message
    Select hash algorithm
    Generate hash value
    Analyze characters, letters, words, and hexadecimal values
    Display hash and analysis

Hash With Encryption:
    Read message
    Select encryption method
    Read key or shift when needed
    Encrypt or transform message
    Select hash algorithm
    Generate hash value from processed message
    Analyze original message
    Display encrypted preview, hash, and analysis

HMAC:
    Read message
    Read secret key
    Select HMAC algorithm
    Generate HMAC value
    Display HMAC result

Verify Hash:
    Read message
    Read received hash
    Select hash algorithm
    Generate new hash from message
    Compare computed hash with received hash
    IF equal THEN display MATCH and integrity preserved
    ELSE display MISMATCH and message may have changed

File Hashing:
    Choose file
    Read file in binary mode
    Generate SHA-256, SHA-512, and SHA3-256
    Display file hash values

END
